        <type>String</type>
        <format/>
        <currency>$</currency>
        <decimal>.</decimal>
        <group>,</group>
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <trim_type>both</trim_type>
      </field>
    </fields>
    <attributes/>
    <cluster_schema/>
    <remotesteps>
      <input>
      </input>
      <output>
      </output>
    </remotesteps>
    <GUI>
      <xloc>160</xloc>
      <yloc>546</yloc>
      <draw>Y</draw>
    </GUI>
  </step>
  <step>
    <name>js-record</name>
    <type>ScriptValueMod</type>
    <description/>
    <distribute>Y</distribute>
    <custom_distribution/>
    <copies>1</copies>
    <partitioning>
      <method>none</method>
      <schema_name/>
    </partitioning>
    <compatible>N</compatible>
    <optimizationLevel>9</optimizationLevel>
    <jsScripts>
      <jsScript>
        <jsScript_type>0</jsScript_type>
        <jsScript_name>Script 1</jsScript_name>
        <jsScript_script>// One customer as labeled lines: the message AI Chat sends
var customer_record = "Name: " + name + "\n" +
  "Email: " + email + "\n" +
  "Phone: " + phone + "\n" +
  "Address: " + address + "\n" +
  "Company: " + company_name;</jsScript_script>
      </jsScript>
    </jsScripts>
    <fields>
      <field>
        <name>customer_record</name>
        <rename>customer_record</rename>
        <type>String</type>
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <replace>N</replace>
      </field>
    </fields>
    <attributes/>
    <cluster_schema/>
    <remotesteps>
      <input>
      </input>
      <output>
      </output>
    </remotesteps>
    <GUI>
      <xloc>320</xloc>
      <yloc>546</yloc>
      <draw>Y</draw>
    </GUI>
  </step>
  <step>
    <name>const-instruction</name>
    <type>Constant</type>
    <description/>
    <distribute>Y</distribute>
    <custom_distribution/>
    <copies>1</copies>
    <partitioning>
      <method>none</method>
      <schema_name/>
    </partitioning>
    <fields>
      <field>
        <name>run_instruction</name>
        <type>String</type>
        <format/>
        <currency/>
        <decimal/>
        <group/>
        <nullif>You check and clean one customer record from a US customer file.
Put each value in the house format: name in Title Case; email in lowercase; phone as +1-555-123-4567; address as Street, City, ST ZIP with a two-letter state code (keep a ZIP only if the record has one); company name in its proper business form, such as Acme Corp or Cloud Services, Inc.
An email with no domain or no top-level domain, such as james@ or sarah.j@company, cannot be fixed: keep it as given.
Answer with one JSON object and nothing else, in exactly this shape:
{"name": "...", "email": "...", "phone": "...", "address": "...", "company_name": "...", "issues": ["one short phrase per problem you found"], "quality": "CLEAN" | "FIXED" | "REVIEW"}
quality is CLEAN when nothing needed a change, FIXED when you fixed every problem, and REVIEW when a value cannot be fixed.</nullif>
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <set_empty_string>N</set_empty_string>
      </field>
    </fields>
    <attributes/>
    <cluster_schema/>
    <remotesteps>
      <input>
      </input>
      <output>
      </output>
    </remotesteps>
    <GUI>
      <xloc>480</xloc>
      <yloc>546</yloc>
      <draw>Y</draw>
    </GUI>
  </step>
  <step>
